{"lines":[{"y":0.033226799918123495,"w":0.12190204620361328,"h":0.016083950990782525,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.080000723866309187},{"h":0.017097868543069938,"c":1,"t":"OK, back to the serving points in the Food Hall, which will all have side dishes, desserts and","w":0.73062911987304691,"y":0.076839527009316511,"x":0.084293255055669453},{"t":"drinks on sale, as well as main courses.","w":0.31893002827962241,"x":0.084362146217794365,"y":0.095930232434529583,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"One serving point we call World Adventures. This will serve a different country's cuisine each","x":0.086296272222212353,"y":0.11424901894516348,"w":0.73479894002278645,"h":0.017176193399058626,"c":1},{"w":0.73273996988932288,"x":0.084259179725196989,"h":0.017677368348282263,"t":"day, maybe Chinese one day and Lebanese the next. The menus will be planned for a week","y":0.13035333281894412,"c":1},{"t":"at a time, so pupils will know what's going to be available the whole of that week.","c":1,"x":0.084245869378684876,"h":0.017145688738783527,"y":0.14609383319532365,"w":0.64215469360351562},{"w":0.69155746459960943,"x":0.084264336547192897,"y":0.16955192962323573,"h":0.017482550882759518,"t":"Street Life is also international, with food from three particular cultures. We'll ask pupils","c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q17","y":0.16860465100676225,"x":0.85390946563017256},{"y":0.18369873839937367,"h":0.017925793206312712,"c":1,"t":"to make suggestions, so perhaps sometimes there'll be food from Thailand, Ethiopia and","x":0.082204591978936037,"w":0.70599817911783858},{"c":1,"w":0.65864054361979174,"y":0.19981089842289879,"t":"Mexico, and then one of them will be replaced by Jamaican food for a week or two.","h":0.017375299029131375,"x":0.086308962847332152},{"x":0.084247721012838964,"h":0.018030955176471353,"c":1,"t":"The Speedy Italian serving point will cater particularly for the many pupils who don't eat meat","y":0.22287480641165458,"w":0.74098459879557299},{"h":0.016840361874853382,"y":0.2379461283527684,"w":0.72653839111328122,"t":"or fish: they can be sure that all the food served there is suitable for them. There'll be plenty","x":0.086312554076664397,"c":1},{"x":0.08426788489880413,"t":"of variety, so they shouldn't get bored with the food.","y":0.25563037626331009,"h":0.016739866618413757,"c":1,"w":0.41374824523925791},{"w":0.71832036336263028,"x":0.086329890220891159,"y":0.27654375602491676,"t":"OK, that's all on the new Food Hall. Now after-school lessons. These are very popular with","c":1,"h":0.017221065516747069},{"c":1,"y":0.29197935452744672,"h":0.017971712793141359,"x":0.08626634642914098,"t":"pupils, particularly swimming - in fact there's a waiting list for lessons. Cycling is another","w":0.70603164672851559},{"t":"favourite, and I'm delighted that dozens of pupils make use of the chance to learn to ride in","h":0.02020004416242227,"c":1,"x":0.086263505467121415,"w":0.72047805786132812,"y":0.30606129152409278},{"y":0.32212967832095019,"w":0.73279602050781256,"h":0.019313915598659248,"x":0.086282235232837651,"t":"off-road conditions. It means that more and more cycle to and from school every day. As you","c":1},{"t":"know, we have a well-equipped performance centre, and we're going to start drama classes","c":1,"h":0.021541068635363203,"w":0.73282903035481772,"x":0.082153885879691399,"y":0.33643853618162933},{"w":0.72451731363932292,"t":"in there, too. Pupils will be able to join in just for fun or work up to taking part in a play - we","h":0.019672218565384814,"x":0.084265515252705536,"y":0.35290451235188158,"c":1},{"y":0.36895667701231294,"t":"hope to put on at least one a year. We already teach a number of pupils to use the sound and","h":0.018486826102500409,"c":1,"w":0.74305796305338534,"x":0.086311633156044815},{"y":0.38482046672446257,"h":0.016754411555852888,"c":1,"w":0.7327100626627604,"t":"lighting systems in the centre. And a former pupil has given a magnificent grand piano to the","x":0.086320152455393498},{"x":0.08424637563116609,"c":1,"h":0.019750121063843551,"y":0.39936738098391023,"t":"school, so a few pupils will be able to learn at the school instead of going to the local college, Q19\/Q20","w":0.82740707397460922},{"t":"as many of them do at the moment.","x":0.086174044806421171,"c":1,"h":0.016739036506140614,"y":0.41589594611971981,"w":0.28435455322265629},{"h":0.014849548205048801,"w":0.10502470652262369,"y":0.47658685378961407,"x":0.086376535526749593,"t":"PART 3","c":1},{"t":"SUSIE:","y":0.50544156929102857,"w":0.047635250091552742,"x":0.088322293039427582,"h":0.010919186757225807,"c":1},{"t":"LUKE:","y":0.53779069755306319,"x":0.086419752772271152,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"c":1,"y":0.62936046485527464,"t":"SUSIE:","x":0.08847736703436368,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.047325102488199877},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"LUKE:","x":0.086419753238264577,"y":0.65988372072884105,"w":0.045267489751180015,"c":1},{"t":"SUSIE:","c":1,"x":0.090534979301364726,"y":0.67587209290870132,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.75145348812225188,"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"LUKE:","x":0.088477366354031015},{"y":0.81249999973899567,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.047325102488199863,"x":0.090534980134500856,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"y":0.82994186033734829,"t":"LUKE:","x":0.090534979107558367},{"t":"So Luke, for our next psychology assignment we have to do something on sleep","w":0.63806732177734371,"x":0.18508850778382566,"y":0.50083810946485563,"h":0.017013854216630708,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1849616394636375,"y":0.51965538744302453,"h":0.012447005025910785,"w":0.10338995615641275,"t":"and dreams."},{"y":0.53176078343872835,"w":0.59695515950520828,"c":1,"t":"Right. I've just read an article suggesting why we tend to forget most of our","x":0.18506291542592274,"h":0.018143930760935123},{"w":0.64625681559244796,"y":0.5467586091381329,"t":"dreams soon after we wake up. I mean, most of my dreams aren't that interesting","x":0.18510940766055975,"c":1,"h":0.017148944598625926},{"x":0.18301301489330277,"h":0.019256589550292413,"y":0.5622107275753101,"w":0.61754465738932285,"c":1,"t":"anyway, but what it said was that if we remembered everything, we might get"},{"c":1,"h":0.018248829880929018,"y":0.57696177801686011,"w":0.63406346638997391,"x":0.18296259297472584,"t":"mixed up about what actually happened and what we dreamed. So it's a sort of"},{"h":0.017503967554746147,"c":1,"t":"protection. I hadn't heard that idea before. I'd always assumed that it was just","x":0.18710518623528599,"y":0.592522413281798,"w":0.61752995808919264},{"t":"that we didn't have room in our memories for all that stuff.","h":0.014679345983498515,"c":1,"x":0.18511711894404415,"w":0.46102218627929692,"y":0.60895665036746915},{"x":0.18511305090020055,"y":0.62481185751242663,"w":0.5886325581868489,"t":"Me too. What do you think about the idea that our dreams may predict the","h":0.016637151738358891,"c":1},{"w":0.33562795003255202,"h":0.016766244868086422,"t":"It's a belief that you get all over the world.","y":0.65600347748971621,"c":1,"x":0.18505814915406976},{"y":0.66933882763562491,"t":"Yeah, lots of people have a story of it happening to them, but the explanation","x":0.18509174636392969,"h":0.018337274468267939,"c":1,"w":0.61335169474283857},{"c":1,"x":0.18503265055930701,"y":0.68404461584369125,"t":"I've read is that for each dream that comes true, we have thousands that don't,","w":0.62789250691731779,"h":0.019606434133504935},{"x":0.1850439621362841,"t":"but we don't notice those, we don't even remember them. We just remember","y":0.70030034496733351,"w":0.61347101847330721,"h":0.019524301319998494,"c":1},{"y":0.71511627930025612,"w":0.63786005655924483,"c":1,"x":0.18518520258457508,"t":"the ones where something in the real world, like a view or an action, happens to","h":0.017510339986309131},{"t":"trigger a dream memory.","x":0.18518518203352211,"y":0.73546511612881282,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.19958848317464192,"c":1},{"w":0.63197418212890621,"t":"Right. So it's just a coincidence really. Something else I read about is what they","x":0.1870975851249877,"y":0.74587791123696656,"h":0.019583914389458612,"c":1},{"h":0.018372725541796697,"y":0.7623366438668786,"x":0.18511465128531096,"w":0.60715916951497384,"t":"call segmented sleeping. That's a theory that hundreds of years ago, people","c":1},{"x":0.18714485232785316,"c":1,"t":"used to get up in the middle of the night and have a chat or something to eat,","y":0.77671059099002904,"w":0.61537089029947922,"h":0.01872609220489041},{"t":"then go back to bed. So I tried it myself.","c":1,"w":0.32120020548502604,"h":0.017195214090695465,"x":0.18506759141873166,"y":0.79414172074411327},{"w":0.65020573933919268,"t":"Well it's meant to make you more creative. I don't know why. But I gave it up after","y":0.82267441843233968,"h":0.017441860778592999,"x":0.18724280968078574,"c":1},{"x":0.18724279371375105,"y":0.84156976730586197,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"a week. It just didn't fit in with my lifestyle.","w":0.33539095560709631},{"t":"Q21","x":0.85802469175214735,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.56249999985917065},{"w":0.039094648361206019,"t":"Q22","h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.86008230553476039,"y":0.68168604623471463,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.092592593422474792,"y":0.90552325556558577,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186213,"t":"106"},{"x":0.71946393976449563,"c":1,"w":0.25445477803548178,"y":0.95414505982847697,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.028536674131072082}],"h":3396,"w":2400}